    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, your name really is Delphine Windermere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How did you know?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guessed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine. You guessed. Three cheers for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's a 'Trilby Asher.' You have the Duke of Caster behind you, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No wonder. She's after that Realmblade. Hmph, she's not trying to keep her ambitions up her sleeve anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like you lot are in far more shit situations than I thought.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is Vina really back in Londinium to take the throne?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'd have to ask her. I don't really care.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you like to care about, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How not to get my clothes dirty more than anything, if I had to say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once I get back, I'll tell my mother she'll want to keep a closer eye on Rhodes Island Pharmaceuticals.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Turns out we were underestimating the 'medical organization.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What, do I not look like a doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll try a little harder next time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now let's lay our cards on the table, Delphine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How many men did the Duke of Windermere deploy on this plate?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have two bodyguards... but I assume they're both dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just after the Sarkaz put this place under lockdown, they tried to break out with me in tow. They failed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Two bodyguards. Very down-to-earth for a Duke's Princess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have eyes on that sword too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can relax. Duke Windermere's not interested in the Sighs of Kings, I can promise you that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So why are you here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Coincidence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me remind you, you owe me one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're capable of leaving right now. I'm guessing Sir 'Trilby Asher' would love to talk with a fellow duke's successor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the Duke of Windermere, fighter of the good fight, knew her own daughter got into an accident on a Sarkaz-surrounded plate, what would she do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I imagine any duke would love to see her competitor take the first turn in fighting Theresis to the last man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, I could be too mean theorizing about him. He's still outside. Maybe he'll invite you for afternoon tea?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be totally frank, Ms. Ines. Your Arts... have saved my life, I can't argue that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But me being trapped here really is just a coincidence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every duke has their own intelligence network in Londinium, whether it's to monitor Sarkaz movements or peep at what the other dukes are doing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we're being completely honest, the latter's more important than the former.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I simply thought Norport Borough would be a suitable place to hide.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "To go further, an AWOL crown heir once part of the Glasgow Gang would be a very meaningful source of intel for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not exactly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Me and Baird just... liked going to the same video shop.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "My guess is, the fact Vina can wander around Norport with the Sighs of Kings, and hasn't been shopped off together with the sword to meet the Duke of Caster...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's because our 'Trilby Asher' wants to use your group's power to settle some of his own problems.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. You're looking for the airship.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's true, no duke would resist the temptation. Even I want to know how the Sarkaz can construct a flying fortress. It'll upend how future wars are fought.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You people really love these 'wars.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd think a Sarkaz mercenary would be just as passionate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, fine. I do owe you one. So, what does Rhodes Island, house of darling doctors, plan to use my life for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like I just said, I've got no bodyguards or troops I can send out for you here. Be as disappointed as you want, Ms. Ines.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't help you, your friends or that 'Trilby Asher' with any of your issues.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can handle our man and the airship ourselves just fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then what do you want? You know full well what I'm worth to Duke Caster, but you still rescued me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not telling me you helped me a bunch just because you're that kind and good of a person?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, but no.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh* Worth asking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'd be hard for us to compete with a duke's power, I'll grant that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And compared to Rhodes Island, I'm afraid the Duke of Caster has more of her energies focused elsewhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I trust you can talk your mother into helping out here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's a very high asking price.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You want the support of my mother stepping up, so you can break free from Duke Caster's control.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know what a tightrope act that's going to be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unfortunately, that's the only choice our house of darling doctors has.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
