    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "37_g1_glasgowboxinggym",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know if their talks with that hotel are going smoothly or not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe... I should've gone with them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, Amiya. Ms. Ines isn't going to put the Doctor in danger. Besides, we're just borrowing their comms station.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know. And I know the sick here need me more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We nailed down a specific evacuation time before they left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll need to withstand the counterattack from the Sarkaz barracks. As long as the dukes and the Sarkaz open fire on each other, the chance is ours to take.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The plan will go smoothly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes... I'm just somewhat uneasy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's... something here that's stifling me. I don't know what it is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "At first, I thought it was just how heavy the atmosphere was in Norport, and after that, I thought... Theresa was wanting to show me something again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it doesn't seem like either of those.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, when I was aboard the landship, I met some who called you 'The King of Sarkaz.' They were Sarkaz themselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What does that mean, to you? You clearly aren't a Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you hope to be a ruler who can lead her subjects? Or a hero who spearheads the charge?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Siege runs a light hand over the Sighs of Kings at her side. The blade is still ice-cold, as ever."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know, Siege, I have to confess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There was a future Theresa showed to all of us... I still firmly believe that the future she recounted is worth living for, more than anything else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But\u2014she gave the crown to me, yet didn't tell me just how I should arrive there. And now, she's... stood opposing us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can only try to convince myself\u2014that this is her way of testing me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I haven't actually decided how I'll face her. What will she say to me? How will she look upon what I'm doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Will the path I chose by myself... disappoint her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know if I'm someone... worth handing the authority of 'The King of Sarkaz.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But still, you chose to undertake that duty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I worry, myself, that I can't be the person they're all expecting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "The hero who can cleave apart Catastrophe, the monarch who can unite the citizenry...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "How am I meant to do that? How am I meant to... respond to hopes that heavy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tear down a wall? Or persuade a few nobles?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shout to the people? Or use silence to display my majesty?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not good at any of that, and Gawain never taught me it either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I spent most of my time in the Glasgow Gang. Beating up rowdy drunkards, running with my friends to help them shake the coppers\u2014that's all I knew.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I learned a few things at Rhodes Island, but that wasn't going to help me figure out what I should do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought... it'd click when I came back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But once Morgan took the lead on the people here, calling me 'Her Royal Highness'... still, I couldn't find a thing to say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know what to do. I'm so glad it was just a temporary trick to keep everyone placated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But then, what if I do genuinely have to take that road?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just couldn't ignore how these people were suffering, that's all it was. And now it's become this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Siege... perhaps that much is enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa once told me that 'The King of Sarkaz' wasn't a duty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I, too... just didn't want to turn away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "37_g6_hotellobby",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor of Rhodes Island, do you like your job?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Yes.;......;No.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well. It seems you believe you're doing something meaningful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does the question need such protracted thought to answer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. So you have grander schemes than your current cause.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Regardless, I can't say I like mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nobody's born in love with all the jockeying and maneuvering. I know I wasn't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If it was possible, I'd use my noble name to buy a big plot of land in some far-flung county and while away my afternoons by the fireplace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "With a small tuskbeast to keep, ideally, and a forest behind the manor, for walks, and pondering questions of literature and poetry and such.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm ashamed to say, I'm a lousy poet. Sometimes I get some practice works of mine published in the Londinium Daily's literary supplement.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The man before you fiddles with his hat, almost visibly embarrassed."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The critics take no notice, but it sends me over the moons.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Still, we know that's not an easy life to make real. The ideal never is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the age we've been cast into. All we can do is act in the way it educates us to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell me, who was here just now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "A Rhodes Island operator.;The owner and doorman of the hotel.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know who I mean, Doctor of Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about this? We can make a deal on the side.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You bring that operator of yours out of this hotel, and continue on with your mission as previously discussed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then once it's done, I'll give you and Her Royal Highness Alexandrina a referral to the Duke.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not as a pawn or a hostage, but as a guest and a friend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're worth working closer with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can be assured, to forever honor her commitments is a tenet of Her Ladyship's.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You're more interested in a Victorian than a Sarkaz.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. We're in Victoria, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't be fooled by her appearances. Do you really think this plate is no more than a lovable little Sarkaz-built prison cell?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I don't think this place is <i>lovable.</i>",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine. Miserable, then. Suit yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "While you're occupied with proclaiming yourselves the royal heirs apparent to Victoria and giving the Infected their jabs, I'll be busy, anyhow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are common Londinium folk in torment here, but those aside, there are great numbers of\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "People taking care to cover their tracks. People with ulterior motives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Duke I serve wishes sincerely that Victoria regains its glory after it strides over the coals, but some aren't envisaging the same thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to root them out. It's another part of my work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "While saving the citizens here is nothing to do with you?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me guess\u2014you're ready to pull from the textbook to criticize me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So. No. It is something to do with me. I pray wholeheartedly that every person may live in peace and good health.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it's not possible, is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Some people can cling to the now, tweaking every little thing by themselves, but some have weightier callings to undertake, even if it's not what they wish for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such as... seeking a future where a nation can find its footing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I respect the former type, but all the same, I hope you wouldn't reject the latter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Every duke could claim the same thing.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "They all think they're seeking a future for the nation.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "That's the source of the disaster Victoria's in now.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014I won't deny it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Some superficials would say the dukes are merely contesting over authority and advantage. It appears you're not one of them, Doctor of Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Authority is only a means, and advantage is only a tool.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What the dukes are truly vying over are the qualifications to lead this country into the future.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Victoria has been dust-laden for long enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the Sarkaz will be the sandpaper that wipes Victoria clean. With some polishing, our nation will shine with glory again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "You really are a lousy poet, Mr. 'Trilby Asher.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
